    "done_when": "On main the six JT-60SA catalogue tests fail with BindingTransformError: binding 'jt60sa-op1-tf-coil-coordinate-element' source rank 1 cannot be reconstructed from leaf rank 0 and 0 structural arrays. The two bindings jt60sa-op1-tf-coil-coordinate-element and jt60sa-op2-tf-coil-coordinate-element in imas_ambix/data/machine_maps/jt-60sa.json read tf/coil/name with struct_array_entry TF1, which consumes the only struct level, so their source_rank becomes 0; that is the only change to the file, made by editing those two lines, so git diff --numstat on it reports 2 added and 2 deleted lines. Any other binding in the file that selects a struct-array entry and declares a source_rank counting the consumed level is reported in the manifest, not changed. This session runs inside the fleet SLURM allocation (SLURM_JOB_ID is set), so the gate runs in place: TMPDIR=/tmp UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=/home/ITER/mcintos/Code/imas-ambix/.venv PYTHONPATH=$PWD command uv run --no-sync pytest -p no:cacheprovider -n 8 tests/data/test_jt60sa_machine_map.py tests/data/test_description_reader.py tests/data/test_description_identity.py tests/data/test_transform_engine.py > <your log> 2>&1; echo EXIT=$?, exiting 0 with every test in the four files passing; the gate log's first line names the revision, the tree and the command, and the log of the same command at the base revision records the six failures. UV_PROJECT_ENVIRONMENT=/home/ITER/mcintos/Code/imas-ambix/.venv PYTHONPATH=$PWD command uv run --no-sync ruff check imas_ambix tests exits 0. No code under imas_ambix changes, no store file is written, and the JT-60SA server is never contacted.",
